[{"id": 40602333, "text": "My word changed in a different way...", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 40602235, "text": "Well done for spotting this! \n<br></br>\nSometimes the ending might change in a different way, but we are mainly working on 's' and 'es'. \n<br></br>\nSometimes the whole word can change (e.g. a 'tooth' and some 'teeth'), and sometimes it doesn't change at all (e.g. a 'sheep' and some 'sheep'). It is good to notice and talk about these too, but they are not the focus of this game.", "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 20, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 20, "name": "My word changed in a different way...", "logCreatedAt": "2021-11-08T10:10:49.238708", "logUpdatedAt": "2021-11-08T10:10:49.238708", "logCreatedById": null, "logUpdatedById": null, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 2942, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 20, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40601675, "text": "<h2>What to do:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Player 1 chooses an object they can see.</li>\n<li>Player 1 says the object's name (e.g. \"chair<span class=\"mwp-orange\">s</span>\") without using any extra words that might give away how many there are (not \"<b>a</b> chair\" or \"<b>a set of</b> chairs\").</li>\n<li>Player 2 says if there is <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">one</span> or <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">more than one</span> and how they know, e.g. \"There is <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">more than one</span> chair because there was a 's' sound at the end.\"</li>\n<li>Try again with other objects you can see!</li>\n<li>Make sure you take turns so you can both have a go at hearing the different sounds!</li>\n</ol>\n<br></br>\n<h2>Remember:</h2>\nWhen there is <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">more than one</span> of something, the ending usually sounds different.\n<ul>\n<li> Sometimes the ending is  's', e.g.  'balls'.</li>\n<li> Sometimes the ending is  'es' (which sounds like 'is'), e.g.  'foxes'.</li>\n</ul>\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 2942, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 91194491, "text": "762286523", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "VIDEO", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 2942, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 4076, "text": "<h2>The aim of the game:</h2>\nUse the sound clues at the end of a word to work out if there is <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">one</span> or <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">more than one</span> of an object.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 2942, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": null, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]